@startuml E-社区与生态
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · E 社区与生态（UC-SUB-E-01 ~ E-03）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · E 社区与生态
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "从业人员" as WORKER
actor "消费者" as CONSUMER

rectangle "E 社区与生态" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-E-01 参与行业圈层交流" as E01
  usecase "UC-SUB-E-02 免费推广优质小店" as E02
  usecase "UC-SUB-E-03 发布招工与求职" as E03
}

MERCHANT --> E01
MERCHANT --> E02
MERCHANT --> E03
WORKER --> E01
WORKER --> E03
CONSUMER --> E02

note bottom of E01
  参与者来自功能描述「同行业商户/从业者」
end note
note bottom of E02
  免费、群众点评、信用加权、非竞价
end note
note bottom of E03
  与 I-05 零工结算联动
end note
@enduml
